==English==
{{was wotd|2020|May|24}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|sneaker|t1=running shoe|net|t2=network}},<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=246726|date=March 2004|nodot=yes}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref> a reference to a person wearing sneakers walking from one computer to another.

